     shared mv64xxx + 28-port sfp-i2c-mux (section 1), so PHY/port-register
     collection plausibly contends on that bus.
BISECT SHORTLIST (in battery order): show platform, show platform port
counters, show platform table internalports — run individually on a stack
containing member 1, conslog armed, one command at a time.

